 !! Protection: reduced (Secure Boot off). Someone with the disk or SD card
    can change this box's software and read its data.
    Raise it later on the :8443 Status page (Secure Boot on); no reinstall.

 Type or paste one public key on one line, for example:
   ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA... alice@laptop
 Its fingerprint is shown back for checking before it's stored.
 Accepted: ssh-ed25519, ecdsa-sha2-nistp256/384, their sk- forms, RSA 3072+.

 ACCESS_KEY_WEAK: RSA keys need at least 3072 bits








